Description:
This is BoringSSL, a fork of OpenSSL. See
https://www.imperialviolet.org/2014/06/20/boringssl.html

Local Modifications:
The pinned Chromium baseline has local SM2/SM3/SM4, RFC 8998, TLCP client,
and libpki SM2 certificate extensions. See src/ssl/gm_protocol.md,
src/crypto/sm2/README.md, src/crypto/sm4/README.gm.md and
//net/gm/SINGLE_LIBRARY_DESIGN.md for boundaries, provenance and validation.
These extensions are not part of upstream BoringSSL or its FIPS validation.
gm_patch/ preserves the local delta against the pinned revision, with an
explicit file inventory, hashes and an index-only replay validation tool.
